  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Austerity and the Implementation of the Europe 2020 Strategy in Spain (2017), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 3 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Austerity and the Implementation of the Europe 2020 Strategy in Spain by Javier Ramos and Esther del Campo was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2017. It is part of the Travail et Société / Work and Society series. Conceptually, the work connects to Austerity, Political science, Geography, Law and Politics.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 3 citations. Citations peaked in 2017 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include Revista Electrónica de Derecho de la Universidad de La Rioja (REDUR) and oekom verlag eBooks. The citing works include 1 journal article, 1 book and 1 book chapter. They come from 3 countries, led by Spain, Brazil and Finland.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 4 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Partnerships for the goals among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
